---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="働く環境 | 株式会社ロウリュ研究所 採用サイト"
  description="福利厚生と、研究棟で働く社員の声を紹介します。"
>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1 class="page-head__title">働く環境</h1>
      <p class="page-head__lead">
        熱い場所で働くからこそ、休み方はまじめに決めています。
      </p>
    </header>
    <picture>
      <source
        type="image/avif"
        srcset="
              /images/band-workplace-640.avif   640w,
              /images/band-workplace-1280.avif 1280w
            "
        sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 68rem, 100vw"
      />
      <source
        type="image/webp"
        srcset="
              /images/band-workplace-640.webp   640w,
              /images/band-workplace-1280.webp 1280w
            "
        sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 68rem, 100vw"
      />
      <img
        class="photo-band"
        src="/images/band-workplace-1280.jpg"
        srcset="
              /images/band-workplace-640.jpg   640w,
              /images/band-workplace-1280.jpg 1280w
            "
        sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 68rem, 100vw"
        width="1920"
        height="1280"
        alt="湖の桟橋に置いた、白樺の枝の束（ヴィヒタ）"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </picture>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section__title">福利厚生</h2>
      <div class="section__body">
        <ul>
          <li>全研究棟のサウナが入り放題（業務時間外に限る）</li>
          <li>年に1回、フィンランド研修の抽選あり</li>
          <li>タオルと館内着は会社が洗います</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section__title">社員の声</h2>
      <ul class="voice-list">
        <li class="voice-list__item">
          <picture>
            <source
              type="image/avif"
              srcset="
                    /images/voice-towel-640.avif   640w,
                    /images/voice-towel-1280.avif 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <source
              type="image/webp"
              srcset="
                    /images/voice-towel-640.webp   640w,
                    /images/voice-towel-1280.webp 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <img
              class="voice-list__photo"
              src="/images/voice-towel-1280.jpg"
              srcset="
                    /images/voice-towel-640.jpg   640w,
                    /images/voice-towel-1280.jpg 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
              width="1920"
              height="1280"
              alt="サウナ室のベンチに掛けたタオル"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </picture>
          <p class="voice-list__quote">入社理由は、ととのったからです。</p>
          <p class="voice-list__person">熱波師／神田研究棟／2023年入社</p>
        </li>
        <li class="voice-list__item">
          <picture>
            <source
              type="image/avif"
              srcset="
                    /images/voice-bucket-640.avif   640w,
                    /images/voice-bucket-1280.avif 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <source
              type="image/webp"
              srcset="
                    /images/voice-bucket-640.webp   640w,
                    /images/voice-bucket-1280.webp 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <img
              class="voice-list__photo"
              src="/images/voice-bucket-1280.jpg"
              srcset="
                    /images/voice-bucket-640.jpg   640w,
                    /images/voice-bucket-1280.jpg 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
              width="1920"
              height="1280"
              alt="沢の水を引き込んだ水風呂"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </picture>
          <p class="voice-list__quote">
            水温が16.1℃になると、夜中でも目が覚めます。
          </p>
          <p class="voice-list__person">
            水風呂の温度管理／横浜研究棟／2021年入社
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="voice-list__item">
          <picture>
            <source
              type="image/avif"
              srcset="
                    /images/voice-laptop-640.avif   640w,
                    /images/voice-laptop-1280.avif 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <source
              type="image/webp"
              srcset="
                    /images/voice-laptop-640.webp   640w,
                    /images/voice-laptop-1280.webp 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <img
              class="voice-list__photo"
              src="/images/voice-laptop-1280.jpg"
              srcset="
                    /images/voice-laptop-640.jpg   640w,
                    /images/voice-laptop-1280.jpg 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
              width="1920"
              height="1280"
              alt="机の上のノートパソコンとコーヒー"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </picture>
          <p class="voice-list__quote">この採用サイトは3回作り直しました。</p>
          <p class="voice-list__person">Web エンジニア／本社／2024年入社</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section__title">一日の流れ（熱波師の場合）</h2>
      <div class="section__body">
        <ol>
          <li>9:30 出勤。サウナ室の温度と湿度を記録する</li>
          <li>10:00 開店。1回目の熱波</li>
          <li>13:00 休憩。社員はまかないのサウナ飯</li>
          <li>15:00〜19:00 2〜4回目の熱波</li>
          <li>19:30 退勤。業務時間外なので、ここからはサウナに入ってよい</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="container">
    <div class="apply-cta">
      <p class="apply-cta__text">
        まずは一度、研究棟の空気を吸いに来てください。
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="/process/">
        応募する
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
